WEBVTT

00:00:28.758 --> 00:00:30.838
(SOBBING)

00:00:54.798 --> 00:00:56.598
(TUMNUS GROANING)

00:01:01.718 --> 00:01:04.238
(GASPING)

00:01:11.358 --> 00:01:13.358
(LAUGHING)

00:01:14.998 --> 00:01:17.718
-Susan, this is...
-Mr. Tumnus!
苏珊 这是…

00:01:19.878 --> 00:01:23.198
Come, we must hurry
and search the castle.
快 我们得赶快搜遍整个城堡

00:01:23.358 --> 00:01:25.558
Peter will need everyone we can find.
彼得将会需要
我们找到的每一个人

00:01:31.198 --> 00:01:32.638
(GROANING)

00:01:52.598 --> 00:01:55.358
Edmund! There's too many!
爱德蒙 他们的人太多了

00:01:55.518 --> 00:01:56.878
Get out of here!
快离开这儿

00:01:57.038 --> 00:01:59.558
Get the girls and get them home!
找到苏珊和露西 带他们回家

00:02:02.358 --> 00:02:04.518
You heard him! Let's go!
你听到了 快走吧

00:02:24.558 --> 00:02:26.038
Peter said get out of here!
彼得叫你快离开这儿

00:02:26.238 --> 00:02:28.038
Peter's not king yet.
彼得还不是国王呢

00:02:53.278 --> 00:02:54.278
(GROANS)

00:02:54.478 --> 00:02:55.478
(INDISTINCT)

00:03:59.118 --> 00:04:01.878
(ROARING)

00:04:05.038 --> 00:04:06.398
Impossible!
不可能

00:04:09.758 --> 00:04:12.078
(ALL CHEERING)

00:04:43.078 --> 00:04:44.598
(GROANING)

00:04:53.198 --> 00:04:55.238
(ROARING)

00:05:21.118 --> 00:05:22.678
It is finished.
都结束了

00:05:24.038 --> 00:05:25.598
-Peter!
-Peter!
彼得
彼得

00:05:31.998 --> 00:05:33.638
Where's Edmund?
爱德蒙呢？

00:05:36.318 --> 00:05:38.478
(GASPING)

00:05:45.358 --> 00:05:46.678
SUSAN: Edmund!
爱德蒙

00:06:19.318 --> 00:06:21.558
(COUGHING)

00:06:40.078 --> 00:06:43.198
When are you gonna learn
to do as you're told?
你什么时候才能学会乖乖听话

